OL,3,GNEWSAAndrew takes legal action over
OL,4,Aarrest search warrants with hearing
OL,5,Athis week
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor is taking
OL,8,Flegal action against Thames Valley
OL,9,FPolice over his arrest in February.
OL,11,FThe former Prince Andrew was arrested
OL,12,Fon suspicion of misconduct in public
OL,13,Foffice, in the wake of information that
OL,14,Femerged from the Epstein files in the
OL,15,FUnited States.
OL,17,FMountbatten-Windsor's lawyers are
OL,18,Fchallenging the search warrants used in
OL,19,FSandringham and at Royal Lodge in
OL,20,FWindsor relating to his arrest, as
OL,21,Ffirst reported by the Telegraph.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
